msgstr "Nightly Inspection 审阅计划只能以 create-draft 生成未就绪的审阅提案。"

#: includes/Governance/Plan_Contract_Validator.php:771
msgid ""
"Nightly Inspection review plans must remain not ready until a human supplies "
